OL,5,G2100 Inside the Ambulance
OL,6,     FSouth Central paramedics treat a
OL,7,     Fpregnant woman who has fallen on
OL,8,     Fher baby bump. Plus, paramedics
OL,9,     Fare called to an unconscious child
OL,10,     Fwith a complex medical condition.
OL,11,G2200 Ambulance
OL,12,     FAs the night shift begins, 82
OL,13,     Fpatients across the North West are
OL,14,     Fwaiting for an ambulance. With a
OL,15,     Fnew call being taken every 30
OL,16,     Fseconds, paramedics are pushed to
OL,17,     Ftheir limits.
