OL,5,G2300 Death Row: Countdown to Execution
OL,6,     FNew. Susanna meets Darlie Routier,
OL,7,     Fwho for 23 years has claimed she
OL,8,     Fhad no part in the murder of her
OL,9,     Ftwo young sons, who were stabbed
OL,10,     Fto death a few feet away from
OL,11,     Fwhere she was sleeping.
OL,12,G0000 999 Rescue Squad
OL,13,     FHit the road with Yorkshire
OL,14,     FAmbulance Service's Hazardous Area
OL,15,     FResponse Team. This episode
OL,16,     Ffeatures a stand-off involving a
OL,17,     Fman with a samurai sword in South
OL,18,     FYorkshire.
